===Netherlands vs FR Yugoslavia===
Just three minutes after [[Slobodan Komljenović]] scored the equalizer, [[Predrag Mijatović]] missed a penalty kick as, after deciding not to hit it to the sides due to [[Edwin van der Sar]]'s reach,<ref>[https://hemeroteca-paginas.mundodeportivo.com/EMD03/HEM/1998/07/01/MD19980701-026.pdf Seedorf dio pistas para el penalti]. [[Mundo Deportivo]], 1 July 1998</ref> the ball hit the crossbar, prompting him to describe it as the worst moment in his career.<ref>[https://elpais.com/diario/1998/06/30/deportes/899157612_850215.html "Es el peor momento de mi carrera"]. [[El País]], 30 June 1998</ref> [[Edgar Davids]] scored the winning goal for the Netherlands in injury time; Davids, suffering a cramp, had asked to be substituted moments before but [[Guus Hiddink]] asked him to stay in the field.<ref>[https://hemeroteca-paginas.mundodeportivo.com/EMD03/HEM/1998/07/01/MD19980701-026.pdf Davids pidió el cambio antes de dar el triunfo]. [[Mundo Deportivo]], 1 July 1998</ref> An apparent scuffle between Van der Sar and [[Winston Bogarde]] in the celebration was explained by the former as an instinctive overreaction from being unintentionally choked by [[Pierre van Hooijdonk]].<ref>[https://www.irishtimes.com/sport/newslines-dutch-clear-the-air-1.168852 Dutch clean the air]. [[The Irish Times]], 1 July 1998</ref>

